Error [jet.InvalidStatement]: `.Rect{…}` mixes a positional entry with field names
  --> tests/ui/named_pattern_mixed_positions.jet:8:18
    |
  8 |         .Rect{w, _} -> w
    |                  ^
 Why: A named-field pattern labels every entry; one pattern uses one form
 Fix: Write `field: pattern` for this entry, or match by position with `.Rect(…)`
